{
  "name": "multibank-spend-tracker",
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "description": "Customisable spending tracker and transaction categoriser for multiple banks and countries (UK + EU, multi-currency). Free bank feeds to Google Sheets (Enable Banking, Starling, Lunch Flow, CSV), refund netting, email-receipt itemisation, yearly budgets for lumpy spend, forecasts, an MCP server and AI-agent skills.",
